<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 21.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 21.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-21</dateline>
<text>
